      "writtenOn": "2026-04-06T17:00:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We explicitly need `OpTypeImage` instead of `OpTypeSampledImage`.\n\nFrom SPIR-V 1.0 spec page 101,104:\n```\nOpImageFetch\nFetch a single texel from a sampled image.\n. . .\nImage must be an object whose type is OpTypeImage.\n```\n\n```\nOpImageRead\nRead a texel from an image without a sampler.\n. . .\nImage must be an object whose type is OpTypeImage with a Sampled operand of 0 or 2.\n```",
      "parentUuid": "6362ec6f_e8c939c0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2335,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2335,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "a86ac0c822d4ad06cba6c0c77a736eaeec271940",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
